  "title": {
    "rendered": "Adjustable aluminum shelves in Vans"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Inclined and height-adjustable shelves made by Pommier-Furgocar are the most advanced and functional solution in box shelving, with the following technical specifications:</strong></h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">All system parts are made of anodized aluminum in order to meet all hygiene and cleanliness specifications inside the box. When open, shelves facilitate the arrangement of merchandise and ex-van sales. An important detail is that the last profile of each shelf protrudes in order to restrain the merchandise. This is also assisted by the slope of the shelves towards the wall of the box.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When transporting pallets, shelves are folded up so as to free up the entire space of the box.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Shelves fold up or down in the easiest possible way, increasing functionality Shelves are comprised of anodized aluminum profiles to enable the proper circulation of air around the products. Each support can carry a weight of 50kg when evenly distributed on the shelf.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Also there is always the possibility to make special constructions according to the customer&#8217;s requirements.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" data-id=\"1384\" data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/20201126_135400-768x1024-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1384 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/20201126_135400-768x1024-1.jpg 768w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/20201126_135400-768x1024-1-225x300.jpg 225w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 768px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 768/1024;\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" data-id=\"1383\" data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/20201126_135416-768x1024-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1383 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/20201126_135416-768x1024-1.jpg 768w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/20201126_135416-768x1024-1-225x300.jpg 225w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 768px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 768/1024;\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" data-id=\"1385\" data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/ΡΑΦΙΑ-TRAFIC-2-1024x768-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1385 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/ΡΑΦΙΑ-TRAFIC-2-1024x768-1.jpg 1024w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/ΡΑΦΙΑ-TRAFIC-2-1024x768-1-300x225.jpg 300w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/ΡΑΦΙΑ-TRAFIC-2-1024x768-1-768x576.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024/768;\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" data-id=\"1382\" data-src=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/ΡΑΦΙ-ΑΛΟΥΜΙΝΙΟΥ-768x1024-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1382 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/ΡΑΦΙ-ΑΛΟΥΜΙΝΙΟΥ-768x1024-1.jpg 768w, https://stathis.com.gr/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/ΡΑΦΙ-ΑΛΟΥΜΙΝΙΟΥ-768x1024-1-225x300.jpg 225w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 768px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 768/1024;\" /></figure>\n</figure>\n",
